IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `je54-nouns`
IMPORT `je54-vintage`
IMPORT `je54-art08-bankruptcy`

-- je54-tests-art08-bankruptcy: Article 8.  Expected values were written from the text of Article 8 in each of the seven deposited versions before this module was run:
-- V1 and V2a list (a) (b) (ba) (c) (d) (e); V2b adds the bank limb as (f); V2c adds the limited liability company limb as (f) and the bank limb becomes (g) (V2d and V2e are the same as V2c);
-- V2f adds (ea), the administration order.  The same scenario (nine kinds of event and an event that is on no limb) is put to every text, with a person of the kind each limb requires and a person of another kind.


`text V1` MEANS `V1, 1 January 2019 to 27 September 2021`
`text V2a` MEANS `V2a, 28 September 2021 to 30 January 2022`
`text V2b` MEANS `V2b, 31 January 2022 to 31 August 2022`
`text V2c` MEANS `V2c, 1 September 2022 to 10 January 2024`
`text V2d` MEANS `V2d, 11 January 2024 to 23 November 2025`
`text V2e` MEANS `V2e, 24 November 2025 to 18 June 2026`
`text V2f` MEANS `V2f, 19 June 2026 to current`
`text inferred` MEANS `the inferred text from 28 March 2003 to 31 December 2018`
`text none` MEANS `no text before 28 March 2003`

GIVEN company IS A BOOLEAN
      llc IS A BOOLEAN
      bank IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Person who may have become bankrupt`
`a person of the kind` company llc bank MEANS
    `Person who may have become bankrupt` WITH
        `is a company` IS company
        `is a limited liability company` IS llc
        `is a bank` IS bank

`an individual` MEANS `a person of the kind` FALSE FALSE FALSE
`a company` MEANS `a person of the kind` TRUE FALSE FALSE
`a limited liability company` MEANS `a person of the kind` FALSE TRUE FALSE
`a bank` MEANS `a person of the kind` FALSE FALSE TRUE

`event: own application` MEANS `the Royal Court grants the person's own application to place the person's property under the control of the Court`
`event: en desastre` MEANS `the person's property is declared en désastre`
`event: debt remission` MEANS `the Viscount grants a debt remission order in respect of the person's qualifying debts under the Debt Remission (Individuals) (Jersey) Law 2016`
`event: general cession` MEANS `the Royal Court grants the person's own application to make a general cession of the person's property`
`event: renounced` MEANS `the Royal Court adjudges the person's property to be renounced`
`event: creditors winding up` MEANS `a company is wound up by means of a creditors' winding up pursuant to the Companies (Jersey) Law 1991`
`event: administration order` MEANS `an administration order is made in respect of a company under Part 20B of the Companies (Jersey) Law 1991`
`event: llc winding up` MEANS `a limited liability company is wound up by means of a creditors' winding up under the Limited Liability Companies (Winding Up and Dissolution) (Jersey) Regulations 2022`
`event: bank winding up` MEANS `a bank winding up order is made under the Bank (Recovery and Resolution) (Jersey) Law 2017`
`event: some other event` MEANS `some other event`

§ `Whether the text lists the event: nine events by seven texts (the person is of the kind the limb requires)`

